---
// 博客与笔记共用的文章布局：标题区 + 正文 + 宽屏右侧目录
import 'katex/dist/katex.min.css';
import '../styles/prose.css';
import Base from './Base.astro';
import type { MarkdownHeading } from 'astro';
import { fmtDateLong } from '../lib/content';

interface Props {
  title: string;
  description?: string;
  date?: Date;
  updated?: Date;
  tags?: string[];
  minutes?: number;
  draft?: boolean;
  headings?: MarkdownHeading[];
  showToc?: boolean;
}
const { title, description, date, updated, tags = [], minutes, draft, headings = [], showToc = true } = Astro.props;
const toc = headings.filter((h) => h.depth >= 2 && h.depth <= 3 && h.slug !== 'footnote-label');
const hasToc = showToc && toc.length >= 3;
---

<Base title={title} description={description}>
  <article class="article">
    <header class="article-header">
      <slot name="kicker" />
      <h1>
        {title}
        {draft && <span class="badge draft">草稿 · 不会发布</span>}
      </h1>
      {description && <p class="article-desc">{description}</p>}
      <div class="article-meta">
        {date && <time datetime={date.toISOString()}>{fmtDateLong(date)}</time>}
        {updated && <span>更新于 {fmtDateLong(updated)}</span>}
        {minutes && <span>约 {minutes} 分钟</span>}
        {tags.length > 0 && <span class="tags">{tags.map((t) => <span>{t}</span>)}</span>}
      </div>
    </header>

    {
      hasToc && (
        <nav class="toc" aria-label="目录">
          <div class="toc-inner">
          <div class="toc-label">目录</div>
          <ol>
            {toc.map((h) => (
              <li class={`d${h.depth}`}>
                <a href={`#${h.slug}`}>{h.text}</a>
              </li>
            ))}
          </ol>
          </div>
        </nav>
      )
    }

    <div class="prose">
      <slot />
    </div>

    <slot name="after" />
  </article>
</Base>

<style>
  .article-header {
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }
  h1 {
    font-size: 1.9rem;
    line-height: 1.35;
    font-weight: 650;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    margin: 0 0 0.6rem;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }
  .article-desc {
    color: var(--fg-soft);
    margin: 0 0 0.9rem;
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
  }
  .article-meta {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.4rem 1.1rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }

  /* 目录：宽屏固定在正文右侧，窄屏收在标题下方 */
  .toc {
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
    margin: -1.5rem 0 2.5rem;
    padding: 0.8rem 1rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 6px;
  }
  .toc-label {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
  }
  .toc ol {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
  }
  .toc li {
    padding-block: 0.15rem;
  }
  .toc li.d3 {
    padding-left: 1em;
  }
  .toc a {
    text-decoration: none;
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  .toc a:hover,
  .toc a.active {
    color: var(--fg);
  }
  @media (min-width: 76rem) {
    .article {
      position: relative;
    }
    .toc {
      position: absolute;
      left: calc(100% + 3rem);
      top: 0;
      bottom: 0;
      width: 13rem;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      border: 0;
    }
    .toc-inner {
      position: sticky;
      top: 2rem;
      max-height: calc(100vh - 4rem);
      overflow-y: auto;
    }
  }
</style>

<script>
  // 目录高亮当前阅读位置
  const links = [...document.querySelectorAll<HTMLAnchorElement>('.toc a')];
  if (links.length) {
    const map = new Map(links.map((a) => [decodeURIComponent(a.hash.slice(1)), a]));
    const io = new IntersectionObserver(
      (entries) => {
        for (const e of entries) {
          if (!e.isIntersecting) continue;
          links.forEach((a) => a.classList.remove('active'));
          map.get(e.target.id)?.classList.add('active');
        }
      },
      { rootMargin: '0px 0px -70% 0px' },
    );
    map.forEach((_a, id) => {
      const el = document.getElementById(id);
      if (el) io.observe(el);
    });
  }
</script>
